# reruns, set-range reloads), the default 30-day window, the PII-safe diagnostics, and the generated-client source's
# request shaping (operation id + snake_case start/end/limit, 404→empty, other non-2xx propagated). The WinUI view
# (MyActivityPage.cs) is exercised by the Release app build.

